\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf4 This is your opener - it explains\'a0
\f3\i why
\f1\i0 \'a0Picasso, Mir\'f3, Dal\'ed all ended up in the same print shop.\
